 "name_zh": "波雷奇历史中心的尤弗拉西苏斯大教堂建筑群",
 "name_zh_source": "unesco_official",
 "name_en": "Episcopal Complex of the Euphrasian Basilica in the Historic Centre of Poreč",
 "name_local": "Eufrazijeva bazilika",
